        0:commonHint('Comparing numerators only','The learner may compare 5 and 3 without considering the denominator.','Use a common denominator: 5/8 versus 6/8. Six eighths is greater.','Draw two bars split into eight equal parts.','Ask the learner to compare the same-sized units.'),
        2:commonHint('Assuming different forms have equal value','The fractions may look close, but they are not equal.','3/4 equals 6/8, not 5/8.','Mark both fractions on a number line.','Ask how far each fraction is from one whole.'),
